  "simulation_assumptions": [
    "Outdoor weather is shared across all rooms with diurnal variation matching historical weather observations.",
    "Indoor CO2 mass balance uses an exact analytical solution for metabolic generation G*N, room ventilation ACH, and outdoor baseline.",
    "Indoor temperature response uses a lumped thermal capacitance model balancing HVAC setpoint, envelope heat transfer, and occupant metabolic dissipation (100 W/person).",
    "Sound pressure level follows standard acoustic decibel power summation of ambient room equipment noise floor and occupant activity noise.",
    "Illuminance is modeled as policy-driven artificial lighting (occupancy vacancy with delay, scheduled, or manual) plus daylight penetration proportional to solar elevation.",
    "Indoor relative humidity is derived from psychrometric moisture balance and saturation vapor pressure at indoor temperature.",
    "Dry-bulb temperature and outdoor relative humidity represent outdoor ambient conditions and are strictly independent of indoor occupancy events.",
    "Controlled seeded Gaussian noise is added to simulate physical sensor measurement variance without non-physical jumps."
  ]
